  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Educational Quality Improvement Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Mejoramiento Calidad Educacin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM WOULD INCLUDE THREE AREAS: (1) QUALITATIVE IMPROVEMENT OF EDUCATION; (2) MODERNIZATION AND DEVELOPMENT OF THE INSTITUTIONAL MANAGEMENT OF THE SECTOR; AND (3) INVESTMENTS IN INFRASTRUCTURE AND EQUIPMENT FOR SCHOOLS. THE PROGRAM WILL FOCUS ON THE PRIMARY SCHOOL SYSTEM.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
